  "paths": {
    "/api/enroll": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Agents"
        ],
        "summary": "Enroll new agent",
        "description": "**First connection** - Agent enrolls to receive unique ID and API key.\n\nThis endpoint is called once when the PowerShell agent starts for the first time.\nIt generates a unique `agent_id` and `api_key` that must be used for all subsequent requests.\n\n### Request Body\n- `agent_name`: Friendly name for the agent\n- `os_version`: Windows OS version (e.g., \"Windows Server 2019\")\n- `hostname`: Computer name\n- `username`: Currently logged-in user\n\n### Response\nReturns the agent credentials to store for future requests:\n- `agent_id`: Unique UUID for this agent\n- `api_key`: API key for authentication\n- `message`: Status message\n\n### Rate Limit\n5 requests per hour per host (to prevent abuse)\n\n### Example\n```json\n{\n  \"agent_name\": \"DC-Audit-Agent-01\",\n  \"os_version\": \"Windows Server 2022\",\n  \"hostname\": \"DC-01\",\n  \"username\": \"DOMAIN\\SYSTEM\"\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "enroll_agent_api_enroll_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EnrollRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Agent enrolled successfully",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EnrollResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Agent already enrolled"
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Rate limit exceeded"
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/beacon": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Agents"
        ],
        "summary": "Send heartbeat and get tasks",
        "description": "**Heartbeat** - Send agent status and receive pending tasks.\n\nCalled regularly by agents (recommended: every 60 seconds) to:\n1. Confirm the agent is still online\n2. Get any pending tasks from the dashboard\n3. Record uptime and other metrics\n\n### Request Body\n- `agent_id`: Agent's unique UUID\n- `api_key`: Agent's API key\n- `status`: Agent status (e.g., \"online\")\n- `uptime_seconds`: How long the agent has been running\n- `last_task_id`: Optional, ID of last completed task\n\n### Response\nReturns pending tasks and recommended beacon interval:\n- `tasks`: Array of tasks to execute\n- `next_beacon_interval`: Seconds until next beacon (typically 60)\n\n### Rate Limit\n100 requests per hour per agent\n\n### Example\n```json\n{\n  \"agent_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-...\",\n  \"api_key\": \"f7a8b9c0-...\",\n  \"status\": \"online\",\n  \"uptime_seconds\": 86400,\n  \"last_task_id\": null\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "beacon_api_beacon_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BeaconRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Tasks returned",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BeaconResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Invalid credentials"
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Rate limit exceeded"
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/results": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Results"
        ],
        "summary": "Submit audit result",
        "description": "**Submit Result** - Agent submits the result of an executed audit task.\n\nAfter executing a task, the agent sends the result back to the API.\nResults are automatically encrypted with AES-256-GCM before storage.\n\n### Request Body\n- `agent_id`: Agent's unique UUID\n- `api_key`: Agent's API key\n- `task_id`: The task that was executed\n- `status`: Execution status (\"success\" or \"failed\")\n- `result`: The audit output (string or JSON)\n- `execution_time_ms`: How long the task took\n- `error_message`: Error details if status is \"failed\"\n\n### Response\nReturns acknowledgment:\n- `message`: Status message\n- `acknowledged`: Boolean confirmation\n\n### Encryption\nResults are encrypted before storage:\n- `result_encrypted`: AES-256-GCM ciphertext (stored)\n- `result_hash`: SHA-256 hash for searching\n- `result_preview`: Safe preview for UI\n\n### Rate Limit\n50 requests per hour per agent\n\n### Example\n```json\n{\n  \"agent_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-...\",\n  \"api_key\": \"f7a8b9c0-...\",\n  \"task_id\": \"task-001\",\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"result\": \"Name    Status\\nSSH     Running\\nWinRM   Running\",\n  \"execution_time_ms\": 1234,\n  \"error_message\": null\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "submit_result_api_results_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AuditResultRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Result received and encrypted",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AuditResultResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Invalid credentials"
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Rate limit exceeded"
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
